sect1.sect2:
Command Explanations
&options-meson;
&meson-buildtype-release;
-D hgl=false: This disables targeting Haiku by default as this guide is for Linux, not Haiku.
-D gles1=false: If you don't need the older version of OpenGL ES, use this option. Some games use GLESv1 still.
-D gles2=false: If you don't need OpenGL ES, use this option.
